<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina revises up 1996 tax collection figures.</title>
<headline>Argentina revises up 1996 tax collection figures.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina collected $237.8 million in income tax and $105.0 million in personal wealth tax in 1996, according to final figures released Wednesday by the Economy Ministry.</p>
<p>Those figures compared with earlier preliminary figures of $235.5 million collected in income tax and $104.5 million in personal wealth tax released late Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
